check 1
# Level generation of the Crystalized Cavern Level 1 (level 113): ScnAm5 starts in
# Harrogath (act 5 open), -seed 1234, idle until frame 20, then the level
# warp (poke `warp 113`, tile 0) on both sides. Compare the dungeon's rooms,
# presets and populated units, and the draws (record_rng.py with the
# poke). Area C (level generation). Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name a5-warp-crystalized-ama
save ScnAm5 --class ama --expansion --act 4 --quests acts=4
seed 1234
ticks 160
seconds 900
channels state rng
at 20 poke warp 113
